OL,3,GNEWSAWater company issues first
OL,4,Ahosepipe ban in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has announced its first
OL,7,Fhosepipe ban caused by drought in more
OL,8,Fthan 50 years, following the lead of
OL,9,Fother suppliers across the West.
OL,11,FBristol Water says its "temporary
OL,12,Frestriction", will come into force from
OL,13,F00:01 BST on Thursday 27 August, to
OL,14,Fprotect water resources in the River
OL,15,FSevern.
OL,17,FWessex Water, Thames Water and South
OL,18,FWest Water have already introduced bans
OL,19,Fthis summer, with the South West
OL,20,Fformally declared as being in drought
OL,21,Fearlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
